  "details": "The toggle for Personal Space is in the old settings menu. This either allows all avatars to disappear, or by disabling it, none at all.\nPersonal Space should be implemented by rank and friends through the Safety menu, or should simply be toggled in the user menu when selecting someone else.\nI also believe that it may be beneficial that personal space should be networked, and work both ways instead of locally. One such example that already has this implemented is the Avatar Interactions toggle. That way, intruders will not be able to see your avatar upon coming too close, unless permission is granted.",
